stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> UNKNOWN
    UNKNOWN --> INACTIVE: confirmed negative
    UNKNOWN --> PENDING: candidate positive
    INACTIVE --> PENDING: candidate positive
    PENDING --> ACTIVE: positive confirmation
    PENDING --> INACTIVE: candidate rejected
    ACTIVE --> RECOVERING: candidate negative
    RECOVERING --> INACTIVE: negative confirmation
    RECOVERING --> ACTIVE: positive again
    ACTIVE --> UNKNOWN: camera down / stale
    INACTIVE --> UNKNOWN: camera down / stale
    PENDING --> UNKNOWN: camera down / stale
    RECOVERING --> UNKNOWN: camera down / stale
